   "path": "SCENE.md",
   "role": "instructions",
   "content": "# Check List\n\nA handwritten checklist that writes itself out, then ticks and strikes through every done item.\n\nCategory: ui-blocks. Length: 4.1 s. WebGL: no.\n\nUse when:\n- A list of features, steps, or done-items should be read in full and then crossed off in a hand-made scene.\n- One line in the list has not landed yet: mark it checked false and it stays clean.\n\nAvoid when:\n- Labels need to wrap across lines, or the list needs numbering or nesting. One label, one line.\n- The list should sit at an angle or wobble: wrap it in paper-wobble.\n\nVariables:\n- items (string): Items, default \"[\\\"Render on your own machine\\\",\\\"No watermark, ever\\\",\\\"Every component MIT\\\",{\\\"text\\\":\\\"Ships as source\\\",\\\"checked\\\":false}]\"\n- font_size (number, 24-120): Font size, default 40\n- list_width (number, 300-1600): List width, default 820\n- item_gap (number, 6-48): Item gap, default 18\n- close_gap (number, 3-24): Close gap, default 9\n- per_step (number, 0.5-6): Letters per step, default 1.6\n- step (number, 1-6): Frame step, default 3\n- stroke_width (number, 1-8): Stroke width, default 3\n- font_weight (enum): Font weight, default \"600\"\n- color (color): Text, default \"#26242c\"\n- box_color (color): Box, default \"#26242c\"\n- tick_color (color): Tick, default \"#6f7f35\"\n- background_color (color): Background, default \"#f1eee7\"\n- seed (string): Seed, default \"checklist\"\n\nSource: https://github.com/Remocn/remocn. Licence: MIT. The scene file keeps the upstream notice.\n"
  },
